  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "A connected resolution trail",
    "overview": "ReturnTail makes merchant finance calm, human, and exact. Warm saffron fields introduce the product; deep plum carries words, controls, and accountability. White records on lavender-white work surfaces make purchases, decisions, and chain observations easy to inspect.\n\nThe signature is a connected trail from purchase through wallet authorization to observed settlement. It expresses progress without collapsing distinct financial states. The website combines generous introductory typography with compact operational data; the application keeps empty states honest and setup actionable. This document records the implemented local build, not a deployment or mainnet verification claim.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Saffron and plum identity, with restrained semantic state colors.",
      "Rethink Sans headings and wordmark; Manrope controls and records.",
      "Fine rules, softly rounded controls, and flat operational panels.",
      "Explicit network, authorization, observation, and confirmation language.",
      "Keyboard focus, responsive layouts, and reduced motion."
    ],
